<title>USA: Chrysler September US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Chrysler September US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp</p>
<p>			Sep 1-30, 1996     Sep 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    57,070	    50,309	    +18.2</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 125,791	   105,364	    +24.4</p>
<p> Import Car		   803	     1,331	    -37.2</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Sep 30, 1996 Jan 1-Sep 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   657,025	   607,054	     +7.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     1,224,284	 1,023,387	    +19.1</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,692	    12,203	    -61.7</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 231 for year to date vs 230 in year ago.</p>
</text>
